{"point":{"id":"editor","title":"Interactive Canvas Runtime","rationale":"CanvasWorkspace owns document-session lifetimes, while CanvasSession exposes separate reactive stores for document, presentation, selection, controls, and status. The tldraw adapter owns live geometry and native undo navigation, committing settled gestures through the domain controller. Shape projection and routing connect semantic diagrams to interactive rendering without persisting every pointer frame.","sourcePaths":["src/features/mapping/MappingPage.tsx","src/features/mapping/workspace/canvasWorkspace.ts","src/features/mapping/workspace/canvasSession.ts","src/features/mapping/tldraw/MappingEditorCanvas.tsx","src/features/mapping/tldraw/MappingEditorRuntime.ts","src/features/mapping/tldraw/CanvasRuntimeContext.tsx","src/features/mapping/tldraw/shapeProjection.ts","src/features/mapping/tldraw/NativeRoutingStore.ts"],"relationships":[{"pointId":"canvas","label":"Owns controllers and commits settled gestures","kind":"ownership"},{"pointId":"storage","label":"Submits workspace changes and publication requests","kind":"call"},{"pointId":"agent-api","label":"Registers browser canvases and handles dispatched commands","kind":"call"},{"pointId":"chat","label":"Hosts chat with the active canvas context","kind":"ownership"}]},"sources":[{"path":"src/features/mapping/MappingPage.tsx","text":"import { extractLayoutTemplate, type LayoutCapture } from '../../../domain/core/diagrams/layoutTemplate';
